Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/kr-rs
Description: Kubernetes in one static binary
 kr is a Kubernetes distribution in a single static binary of about 3 MB,
 written in Rust with no libc and no third-party crates: API server,
 datastore, scheduler, controllers, kubelet, container runtime, pod network,
 service proxy and cluster DNS. Needs Linux 5.10 or newer with cgroup v2 and
 overlayfs. Systemd units kr-server.service and kr-agent.service are
 installed but not enabled.
